<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage of Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc with a long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $48 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects Anheuser-Busch will post share earnings growth through 2001 &quot;despite the millstone of a near-static U.S. beer market.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said expects 1997 to be a challenge for the company due to competition in the domestic beer market.</p>
<p>-- said expects the company to earn $2.43 a share for the full year 1997.</p>
<p>-- Anheuser-Busch gained 3/16 to 42-9/16.</p>
</text>
